<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.genesis.overturns ~ kāhuli: the tier as the argument

`lares nexus kahuli <engine | grammar>` reports and advances one ratchet tier of the Nexus's genesis composition: engine (slow, signed into every delegation edge, held until the forward-rebind rules) or grammar (the required memetic-wikitext grammar alone). `apply=true` stands held while the overturn's payload waits to be wired. An operator's own plugins move through `nexus publish`, never here.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ grammar

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`grammar` params=`tier/grammar ~ read the grammar tier`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ tier · apply

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`tier` params=`takes/word needs/required seat/1 as/<engine|grammar> ~ the tier`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`apply` params=`kind/switch ~ apply the overturn; held today`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ quorum

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`quorum` params=`who/hand key/seat ~ an overturn moves the mesh's reading`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.genesis.overturns tier/grammar]] ~ an unknown tier`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ read

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`read` params=`exit/0 ~ the tier's diff`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares nexus kahuli

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares nexus kahuli]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

